    {
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "createdAt": 1780743026561,
      "changelog": "xiaozhi-teach-english-listening-designer v1.0.0\n\n- Initial release focused on transforming English listening teaching from simple practice to systematic skills training.\n- Provides a structured workflow: listening goals → material selection → pre-listening prediction → in-listening tasks → post-listening activities → micro-skill training.\n- Supports differentiated goals (main idea, details, inference, attitude) and layered listening (extensive/intensive/dictation).\n- Details methods for material selection, legal compliance on copyrights, and aligning difficulty to learner level.\n- Includes practical strategies for pre-listening, layered listening tasks, post-listening reflection, and micro-skill coaching.\n- Integrates with student performance analyzers and lesson planners for seamless listening ability tracking.",
      "changelogSource": "auto"
